is renowned for her beauty.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:27.790
She's kind and smart, and graced with many talents.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:27.790
She's loved by young and old, men and women. 

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:32.040
She's flawless, the perfect high school girl.

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.950
Well... that's what everyone seems to think.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:41.080
This is Umaru when she's at home.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:44.330
My lazy, dried fish of a sister... a himouto.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.660
HEY! Get up, Umaru!

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.080
Gah! What, what's going on?

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:54.330
Now look here, Umaru:

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:54.330
summer vacation isn't just for lazing around!

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:59.700
It's a time for you to do and experience things

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:59.700
you don't usually have the chance to at school.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.000
Are you listening?

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:08.200
Don't you worry, Big Brother.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:08.200
I may not look it, but I've changed. 

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.080
See?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:15.830
I always read Jumpu, but today I got Jumpu SQUARE!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.790
JUMPU

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.790
Square

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.790
Yen

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:15.830
Square

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:21.370
Still, I'm not so sure what "Square"

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:21.370
is supposed to mean...

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:25.750
This is not good. I have to at least get her outside!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.080
Oh, yeah...

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.040
SUMMER

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.040
FIREWORKS

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.040
FESTIVAL

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.950
Umaru! There's a fireworks festival today!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:35.750
SUMMER

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:35.750
FIREWORKS

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:35.750
FESTIVAL

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:33.160
You want to go?

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:35.910
There will be lots of big, beautiful fireworks!

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:37.000
Huh?

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:40.700
The first thing is to try to get her

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:40.700
to an event that she'd like. 

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:47.080
Nah, no thanks. There's too many people,

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:47.080
and insects, and it'll be hot.

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:48.250
This isn't working. 

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:52.330
Man, I was thinking we could buy some food

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:52.330
from the stalls there...

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:54.370
Stalls!

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:58.250
I'm not buying all that! How greedy can you be?!

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:01.580
This is no time for sitting around! Let's go, Big Brother!

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.450
The festival's at NIGHT!

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.120
Don't sweat the small stuff.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.540
Umaruuun!

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.580
Umaruuu                                  uuuuun

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.540
She really is a different person outside...

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.700
We should invite the others. Let's start with Ebina!

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:16.450
Oh, so she wanted to go with her friends?

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.000
FIREWORKS FESTIVAL

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.000
August 13 (Sunday)

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.000
Starts at 7:00 pm!

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:18.330
Put simply...

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:22.950
You invite Taihei to the fireworks festival.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:22.950
That will create just the right mood. 

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:24.160
Fireworks?

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.620
M..mood?!

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:33.040
SUMMER

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:31.790
Wow...

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:34.120
It's great, isn't it, Ebina?

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:38.290
SUMMER

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.080
Oh, sorry. 

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:38.040
I-it's fine!

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:43.120
N-n-no!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.200
That's too embarrassing!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.660
What are you talking about?

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.660
We've already been to the beach together, right?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:50.620
Huh?

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:52.790
I wonder who that is...

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.080
Taihei and Umaru!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:00.370
H-hello, Umaru, Taihei. 

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:08.120
Ah, Kirie. You're visiting Ebina, huh? Perfect timing.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:08.120
What do you say we all go to the fireworks festival?

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.040
TACHIBANA

00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:14.330
The fireworks festival, you say? Of course I will go!

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:16.700
I'm glad. Now we can all go together!

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:17.540
Shba!

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.160
Well, come on in, everyone. 

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.290
Huh? You don't want to go yet?

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:25.830
There are preparations to be made! And you too, Taihei.

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:27.120
Huh? Me?

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:32.330
Yes, indeed! A fireworks festival

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:32.330
means one must wear a summer kimono!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.160
Well, let us depart!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:40.370
Yeah, let's go.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:42.000
No reaction!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.120
You still have a lot to learn, Big Brother.

00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:47.040
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:51.120
Takoyaki        GRILLED SQUID

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:57.040
Jumbo Franks

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:57.040
Chicken Skewers

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:59.540
Indeed, the stalls!

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:59.540
The stalls!

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:00.120
Indeed, the stalls!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:03.000
Shaved Ice

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:03.000
Akashiyaki

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.700
There are so many!

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.580
We shall visit them all!

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.540
Shaved Ice

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.540
GRILLED SQUID

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.160
What can I get you all?

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.000
Shaved Ice

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.000
Akashiyaki

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.580
Huh?! No, I can pay for myself. 

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:09.700
You don't have to worry about that today. 

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.660
O-okay...

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.500
Keep it up, Ebina. 

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.700
Shbababababa!

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:20.950
Shaved Ice

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.160
Shugaan!

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.200
SHUGAAAAN!

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:27.580
GRILLED SQUID

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.450
GRILLED SQUID

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:28.450
FESTIVAL

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.410
Okay, let's sit her and watch. 

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.700
This is an especially large star mine, indeed!

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.290
Amazing!

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:48.080
They sure make a lot of sound, huh?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.700
Wow...!

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.200
So pretty.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.580
Impressive fireworks, indeed!

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:04.790
I may not look it, but I've changed.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:06.660
We should invite the others.

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:09.910
My younger sister is a "himouto," but... 

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:14.370
while some things don't change,

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:14.370
little by little, some things do. 

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.700
Hey! Get up, Umaru.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.160
G'morning...

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:26.410
It's time to go to school. Summer vacation's over. 

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:28.620
Don't keep Ebina waiting. 

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.620
Huh? Do you have the day off today?

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:34.910
Yeah, to make up for lost vacation time. 

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.580
Are you gonna go somewhere?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.910
Hmm... to go buy groceries, I guess. 

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.700
Ah! Then buy some potato chips!

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.330
Yeah, sure. 

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.450
Thanks, Big Brother!

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.790
It's lunchtime!

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.540
And we shall all eat together!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:57.950
Oh, Umaru, the teacher was looking for you earlier. 

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:59.830
Huh? What for?

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:02.870
To give you your certificate from that awards ceremony.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:06.410
Oh, yeah. It always takes a while

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:06.410
to actually get your award, huh?

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:10.160
It's been on display in front

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:10.160
of the staff office this whole time. 

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:15.830
I heard that the last time two people got awards

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:15.830
at the same time was 10 years ago!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:20.700
Hm? 10 years ago? That might have been my brother. 

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.620
Huh?!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.540
Apparently, he always had

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.540
the top grades in his school year.  

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:25.950
That's what Bomba said. 

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.330
This brother and sister have some impressive specs!

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:31.410
Oh, really? Your brother is amazing!

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:35.200
I like Umaru's brother, indeed!

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:40.500
Bread Day

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:40.410
This bread is cheap! Maybe I'll make cream stew today.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.870
After all, he is SO kind-hearted!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:47.700
He brought souvenirs and bought us

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:47.700
so many things at the festival!

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.370
Shaved Ice

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:49.120
That was a shock!

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.750
What's more, he's kind

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.750
and makes you feel at ease somehow.  

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:55.660
Yes. That he does...

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:08.620
Ah! No, Ebina, I was just thinking,

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:08.620
I'd like a brother like that!

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:10.790
Y-yeah. 

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.950
Really, that's all!

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.160
Y-yeah!

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:20.620
I have to go to the principal's office,

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:20.620
so you all go on ahead.

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.540
Very well!

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.830
Okay. See you later, Umaru. 

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:27.120
U-until tomorrow. 

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.040
PRINCIPAL'S OFFICE

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:31.910
Taihei Doma sure was something else. 

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.330
"Taihei the Demon," they called him. 

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:38.540
Takes you back, doesn't it? He was an excellent student.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.410
Your brother is amazing!

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.580
I like Umaru's brother, indeed!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.620
And makes you feel at ease somehow.  

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.750
He was an excellent student.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:04.080
Big Brother!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.500
Looks like he's just come back from shopping. 

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.330
I know! I'll scare him from behind!

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:12.450
This is sure to give him a shock!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:14.870
Here goes!

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.290
Biiig Brothe-!

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.080
Yoshida

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.080
Co-Op

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.080
Residents

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:24.080
Wanted!

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:23.450
Big Brother!

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.080
Huh?!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.750
Um, I think you've got the wrong person...

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:31.370
Huh?

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:33.410
B-Big Brother?

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.200
Oh, Umaru. Welcome back. 

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:42.200
Huh? I feel like I've seen this girl somewhere before...

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.750
That's it, at the awards ceremony.

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.750
She's the girl from the AP class.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.870
Oh, I see. She's a friend of yours, huh?

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:53.910
W-well, we go to the same school

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:53.910
but I wouldn't say we're friends...

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:58.120
I don't like the outdoors... I want to go inside!

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.910
Oh. You want to come in?

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:00.700
Huh?!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.750
Just make yourself at home. 

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:13.040
U-um, your name is Kongo, isn't it?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.450
What brings you over today?

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.450
This is the first time we've talked, isn't it?

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:19.700
There's no need to keep up appearances,

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:19.700
so just lounge around as always. 

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:20.660
Huh?

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:24.870
Gah! She knows about me!

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.410
Sensei is always lounging around. 

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:29.160
Always lounging...

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:31.540
Wh-who is this girl?

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:35.450
I've never even talked to her before,

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:35.450
but she's fixated on Big Brother...  

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.250
She's way too mysterious!

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:40.620
Big Brother is MY big brother. 

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:41.500
Huh?

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:44.000
He's my big brother. 

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:46.580
I do feel like I know her from somewhere...

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.250
I heated up some bread. Would you like some?

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:55.750
Thanks very much. 

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:59.660
Ah! My bread!

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:03.080
What is it, Umaru? Ah! You've eaten it already?

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:06.410
This girl ate it all! In, like, a second!

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:10.870
There's no way a little girl like this

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:10.870
could eat THREE of them. 

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:12.700
It's true!

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:17.250
H-Hikari?

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.000
It is! It's Hikari!

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:24.660
You're Kanau's younger sister, aren't you?

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:24.660
You sure have gotten bigger! 

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.910
Huh? You know her!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.830
You remember that girl

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.830
from when we went to Hamamatsu?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.290
That was my boss, Kanau. 

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.120
And Hikari is her younger sister. 

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:37.370
It's been a REALLY long time since I've seen her,

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:37.370
but I remember now. 

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.910
B-Big Brother...

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:44.000
No, no, no, no, no no no! That's MY big brother! 

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.000
Well, I'll be leaving now. 

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:51.660
Will you be okay? Do you want me to walk you back?

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:52.870
No, I'll be fine.  

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:55.200
I've got some cream stew that will be ready soon...

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:58.290
I-I'll come back again sometime.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.540
You will?!

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:02.000
B-bye.

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:02.580
Yeah.

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:04.370
Say hi to Kanau for me. 

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:05.290
I will. 

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.950
It is! It's Hikari!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.620
Why does she call you "Big Brother"?

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:42.410
I'm not sure... she did used to call me that, though. 

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.950
He's my big brother. 

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:47.910
Why did she suddenly show up today?

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:50.120
Huh? To hang out with you, right?

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:54.120
I've never hung out with her! That girl's just fishy!

